00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Automatically create a test穿服

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Click on the file in the upper left corner and select import

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Then select the OPJ or FBX file to import them

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
In the import window, remember to click on the Automatically create a test穿服 function

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Find the display virtual model settings in the 3D display window

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
You can select display test穿服 below

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,000
To apply the test穿服 information for the costume, please put the costume on a virtual model with test穿服 information

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
In the 3D display window, open the test穿服 display

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
You can check the test穿服 information with the costume

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Enter a new virtual model and confirm that you have selected the Automatically create a test穿服

11
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Use the Automatically adjust version

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Epanet will automatically adjust the costume to match the size of the virtual model

